# Get Tenant Inventory Details

This endpoint retrieves the inventory details for a specific tenant identified by the `id` parameter.

## Response

The response for this request is a JSON object representing the inventory details for the specified tenant. The JSON schema for the response can be documented as follows:

``` json
{
  "type": "object",
  "properties": {
    "id": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "The unique identifier for the tenant"
    },
    "name": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "The name of the tenant"
    },
    "inventory": {
      "type": "array",
      "items": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "item_id": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "The unique identifier for the inventory item"
          },
          "item_name": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "The name of the inventory item"
          },
          "quantity": {
            "type": "integer",
            "description": "The quantity of the inventory item available"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}

 ```

